data: {"id": "5f1232962de8409e-final", "run_id": "5f1232962de8409e", "seq": 1627, "ts_ms": 1788427651712, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2 处于 CreateContainerConfigError 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: `CreateContainerConfigError` (container: app) | 确认容器处于配置错误导致的等待状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_message`: `couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` | 提供导致配置失败的精确缺失 Key 及 Secret 名称 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Normal Pulled`: Container image `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine` already present (x418 over 90m) | 排除镜像拉取失败，确认为本地镜像拉取成功 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.phase`: `Pending`, `ContainersReady`: `False`, `Ready`: `False` | 验证 Pod 整体处于 Pending 且不可用状态 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"CreateContainerConfigError\"}`: `1` | 独立指标确认 Pod 等待原因为 CreateContainerConfigError |\n\n当前 Kubernetes 事件与状态已明确指示配置引用失败，且镜像拉取正常。Metric 独立确认了该等待原因。Logging 和 Tracing 工具调用因权限或执行失败（Forbidden），但鉴于容器未启动，缺乏业务日志符合预期，不作为关键缺失项。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置引用 Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中不存在的 key `unavailable-key` → \nKubernetes 校验并报错 → \nkubelet 抛出 CreateContainerConfigError 阻止容器启动 → \nPod 持续处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为：Pod `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2` 的容器配置请求了一个在 Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中实际不存在的 Key（`unavailable-key`）。\n\n这直接导致了 `CreateContainerConfigError`，使得容器无法启动且 Pod 始终处于 Pending 状态（证据 1、2、4、5）。Kubernetes 事件明确指出无法找到该 Key（证据 2），排除了镜像拉取问题（证据 3）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 15.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 66.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2: 66.7s (Evidence 58.3s, RCA 8.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 90.713, "metrics": {"run_id": "5f1232962de8409e", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 90.71754097938538, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 90717.54097938538, "llm_calls": 19, "llm_duration_ms": 83825.82068443298, "tool_calls": 22, "executed_tool_calls": 16, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 5, "successful_tool_calls": 21, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 15556.493043899536, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 6288.94305229187}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 15803.741455078125, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 66685.77718734741, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 8201.042652130127, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

